retrieval while their perplexity interval includes no change; the window with a sink at a
{{ phase10.analysis.summary.ppl_blind_worst.budget | budget }} budget keeps
{{ phase10.analysis.summary.ppl_blind_worst.niah_retention | pct }} of retrieval at a perplexity ratio
